            "review_title": "Review at Frenchy Lounge",
            "review_text": "Mei Ling M\nMacao, China726 contributions\n0\nClassy • Comfy • Fabulous\nJun 2018 • Family\nRight in the “Old Quarter Hà Nội” where traditional and cultural vibe can be found, you can also find Frenchy Wine Lounge an atmosphere where you can relax in a western settings. \n\nWhen you enter a hotel, you’ll take a stairs to a mezzanine floor where the lounge is located.\n\nUpon entrance, you’ll feel that you’re in a completely different world compare with what you see from the outside.\nSo I highly recommend this for those who wants variety of wines, live music performance, classy settings, comfort and European-Western like atmosphere. \n\nClassy: \nThe decor, look & feel with dim lights makes it so mysterious and classy. The decor filled with wine glasses all over and as well as white grand piano in the middle, cigar, and all that makes is so classy. \n\nComfortable: \nA choice of coach setting or high chair with seats with built-in cushion feel makes it so comfortable and relaxing.\nSo in a long day, you can unwind in this place.\n\nFabulous: \nThe theme is really about wine so accompanying it with cold cuts and cheese is always good. For those who are meat eater or if you’re hungry like I was well they also served a good tender steak. \n\nMUSIC: \nSupper cool, English, Vietnamese, Chinese of your choice could be pleasantly available for your ears. \n\nTo my circle of friends visiting Hà Nội, I’ll definitely recommend this place to chill, relax, have a bottle of wine or unwind and recharge.\nRead more\nWritten June 30, 2018",
