            "review_text": "Nam N\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nA place of music and wine\nOct 2017 • Friends\nLocated inside a 3-star hotel, but Frenchy lounge is not a typical hotel lounge. Owned and run by an MC/singer, this place is indeed a place for music-lovers. A striking 20~30 seats lounge that allows guests to enjoy a drink and bask in the warmth of friendly surroundings and beautiful pieces of music. You don't have to be a wine expert or a snob, just go there to relax with friends and have a good time together.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 26, 2017",
